{"parse":{"title":"Mace (disambiguation)","pageid":7519,"redirects":[{"from":"Mace","to":"Mace (disambiguation)"}],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Mace</b> was a common given name, held by, among others:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mace_Windu\" title=\"Mace Windu\">Mace Windu</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Master\" title=\"Jedi Master\">Jedi Master</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mace_Windu/Legends\" title=\"Mace Windu/Legends\">Mace Windu</a>, the Legends version of the <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Master/Legends\" title=\"Jedi Master/Legends\">Jedi Master</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mace_Towani\" title=\"Mace Towani\">Mace Towani</a>, a youth</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mace_(Sith_apprentice)\" title=\"Mace (Sith apprentice)\">Mace</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Sith_apprentice/Legends\" title=\"Sith apprentice/Legends\">Sith apprentice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Macemillian-winduart%C3%A9\" title=\"Macemillian-winduarté\">Macemillian-winduarté</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Squib/Legends\" title=\"Squib/Legends\">Squib</a> also called Mace</li></ul>\n<p>Other uses included:\n</p>\n<ul><li>the <a href=\"/wiki/Mace_fly\" title=\"Mace fly\">mace fly</a></li>\n<li>the <a href=\"/wiki/Mace_(weapon)/Legends\" title=\"Mace (weapon)/Legends\">mace</a>, a weapon</li>\n<li>the <a href=\"/wiki/Vibro_mace\" title=\"Vibro mace\">vibro mace</a></li></ul>\n<hr />\n<p><i>This is a <a href=\"/wiki/Wookieepedia:Naming_policy\" title=\"Wookieepedia:Naming policy\">disambiguation page</a>&#8212;a navigational aid that lists other pages that might otherwise share the same title. If an article link referred you here, you might want to go back and fix it to point directly to the intended page.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<div id=\"p-lang\" style=\"padding-left=0.5px; padding-right=0.5px;\">\n<div>In other languages</div>\n<div class=\"pBody\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"interwiki-de plainlinks\" title=\"de:Mace\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.jedipedia.net/wiki/Mace\">Deutsch</a></li><li class=\"interwiki-nl plainlinks\" title=\"nl:Mace\"><a href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/nl/wiki/Mace\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:nl.starwars:Mace\">Nederlands</a></li><li class=\"interwiki-pt plainlinks\" title=\"pt:Mace\"><a href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/pt/wiki/Mace\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:pt.starwars:Mace\">português</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>","properties":{"disambiguation":""}}}